Aṅgada says meet princes together with Vaidēhī --- Aṅgada boasts alone he can destroy Laṅkā --- Aṅgada vows to crush Rāvaṇa sons brothers and armies --- Aṅgada claims he shatters Indrajit Brahmā missiles --- Aṅgada praises Jāmbavān Hanumān Nīla Panasa strength --- Aṅgada touts Mainda Dvivida and twin boon-drunk heroes --- Aṅgada calls return without Sītā improper --- Jāmbavān approves spirit but defers to Rāma mind
